## Fluid (R3) SoundFont — `FluidR3_GS.sf2` (bundled) and `FluidR3_GM.sf2` (optional)

The app ships the small FluidR3 GS bank (`src-tauri/resources/FluidR3_GS.sf2`) and plays
through it by default, so it works with no network access. The full 142 MB FluidR3 GM bank can
be downloaded on request, from the `pianobooster/fluid-soundfont` release v3.1, which mirrors
the Ubuntu/Debian `fluid-soundfont-gm` package; it is checked against a pinned SHA-256.

